    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.bufremove\n\n### Description\n\nWhen removing the _last_ buffer in a window and that buffer is a _help_ file, the following error occurs:\r\n\r\n```\r\n   Error  21:25:39 msg_show.emsg E5108: Error executing lua: ...al/share/nvim/lazy/mini.bufremove/lua/mini/bufremove.lua:152: Error executing lua: vim/_editor.lua:0: nvim_exec2(): Vim(bprevious):E85: There is no listed buffer\r\nstack traceback:\r\n\t[C]: in function 'nvim_exec2'\r\n\tvim/_editor.lua: in function 'cmd'\r\n\t...al/share/nvim/lazy/mini.bufremove/lua/mini/bufremove.lua:166: in function <...al/share/nvim/lazy/mini.bufremove/lua/mini/bufremove.lua:152>\r\n\t[C]: in function 'nvim_win_call'\r\n\t...al/share/nvim/lazy/mini.bufremove/lua/mini/bufremove.lua:152: in function <...al/share/nvim/lazy/mini.bufremove/lua/mini/bufremove.lua:142>\r\n\tvim/shared.lua: in function 'tbl_map'\r\n\t...al/share/nvim/lazy/mini.bufremove/lua/mini/bufremove.lua:128: in function 'unshow'\r\n\t...al/share/nvim/lazy/mini.bufremove/lua/mini/bufremove.lua:238: in function 'delete'\r\n\t...l/share/nvim/lazy/LazyVim/lua/lazyvim/plugins/editor.lua:323: in function <...l/share/nvim/lazy/LazyVim/lua/lazyvim/plugins/editor.lua:323>\r\nstack traceback:\r\n\t[C]: in function 'nvim_win_call'\r\n\t...al/share/nvim/lazy/mini.bufremove/lua/mini/bufremove.lua:152: in function <...al/share/nvim/lazy/mini.bufremove/lua/mini/bufremove.lua:142>\r\n\tvim/shared.lua: in function 'tbl_map'\r\n\t...al/share/nvim/lazy/mini.bufremove/lua/mini/bufremove.lua:128: in function 'unshow'\r\n\t...al/share/nvim/lazy/mini.bufremove/lua/mini/bufremove.lua:238: in function 'delete'\r\n\t...l/share/nvim/lazy/LazyVim/lua/lazyvim/plugins/editor.lua:323: in function <...l/share/nvim/lazy/LazyVim/lua/lazyvim/plugins/editor.lua:323>\r\n\r\n```\n\n### Neovim version\n\nNVIM v0.9.0-dev-1292+geac75a971\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. `nvim -nu minimal.lua`\r\n2. `:h only` (or any unlisted buffer)\r\n3. `:only`\r\n4. `:lua require(\"mini.bufremove\").delete(0, false)`\r\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe unlisted buffer should be deleted.\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nAn error is thrown (as shown above).",
