            "body": "I can not reproduce it on neither Neovim 0.8.3 nor on `NVIM v0.9.0-dev-1296+g8b7fb668e` (latest available Nightly release). Also can not reproduce neither with minimal setup (only 'mini.nvim' added to `packpath`) nor with my day-to-day setup (all my used plugins are enabled).\r\n\r\nHere is a demo of Nightly with minimal setup:\r\n\r\nhttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24854248/228762587-61cb72a2-4c7c-47d7-baba-b038ef15e206.mp4\r\n\r\n---------------\r\n\r\nWhat kind of setup you actually used in `nvim -nu minimal.lua` step? It seems like there is some other plugin interfering with buffer list.",
